 r←GetReadmeSweepFilename registryPath
⍝ Returns the name of the file recording when READMEs were last swept, a sibling of
⍝ "tatin_index.txt" in the root of the Registry rather than inside any package folder,
⍝ because it is about the Registry as a whole. Fields: see `ReadmesAreDue`.
 r←(F.AddTrailingSep registryPath),'apl-readme-sweep.json'
⍝Done
